        "kind": "steps",
        "body": "${{a}}^{{{n}}} = {{a}} \\cdot {{a}}{{= if(n > 2, 1, 0) | raw}}$ … $= {{= a^n}}$\n\nSchrittweise: ${{a}} \\cdot {{a}} = {{= a*a}}$, ${{= a*a}} \\cdot {{a}} = {{= a*a*a}}$"
